  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — McKinsey: Banks Are Drowning in AI Agent Bills | November 10, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — McKinsey: Banks Are Drowning in AI Agent Bills | November 10, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              November 10, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              McKinsey: Banks Are Drowning in AI Agent Bills\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Banks deployed AI agents to cut costs — and are now discovering they come with a hefty tab of their own. McKinsey's latest research reveals financial institutions are <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPWlk5SWg5U2ZDeExQOUMycHJsMWoycHpLYWY2S2Ntc3RhZllRcTBFTnpQSlU1eF96emQ3S1VRRFoybFdBaHZvR1k4TmFDd19uT3huaElhUzhmaUtlTW1LaEZjSmZCbENrenRkNzJjMlZwcDN6QW1zc2hHUFYtbHJJYTZWV09yRHllSWtmZ1ZNa1FEZ1NyYVdiRFdibi1OOURTLWpXSGhNRnE?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">scrambling to rein in soaring AI agent operating costs</a>, catching even well-resourced institutions off-guard.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">McKinsey's new report finds banks are actively restructuring technology budgets to account for rapidly rising AI agent costs</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Spending is driven by inference compute, human-in-the-loop oversight, and integration complexity — costs that compound at scale</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Banks that deployed agents without unit-economics modeling are most exposed to budget overruns</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">A widening gap is emerging between early AI adopters who pre-planned for scale costs and fast-followers who did not</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Multiple major financial institutions are now taking concrete action to control AI agent spending, per McKinsey</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">The CIO and technology budget cycle at most banks was not designed for AI agents' usage-based economics. Unlike traditional software licenses, AI agent costs scale directly with task volume and complexity — a successful rollout can generate a surprisingly large and fast-growing bill with no natural ceiling.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Institutions that treat AI agent spend as a P&amp;L line item — not just a capital project — will gain a structural advantage. Banks that act now to build proper cost governance frameworks and rigorous ROI models will be better positioned as agent adoption accelerates industry-wide.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Anthropic Unveils Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2, 20% Cheaper</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPOVd0Y19lNml4Q0k4QmpKeWVfZWt0RUxoa0dUNUN4TG1GM2xpVmhaU1I5ellJUFVLM0FpeW1qS2JJMUVUWkc1MTNSWEtBZDV6eFFEY3l0aDhvN3JjbW00WVd5Y2FjOVVETXB6NmdaNXVYT0NUcHhMX1JmQ0VYZ2VLUUpob2t6VUVZNDg1TDQ2bFdXQ05tQm1CRg?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">JournalArta</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic released Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2, cutting model pricing by 20% and improving generation speed by 30%. The models have reportedly tackled complex physics problems including black hole research.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Lower cost curves for frontier models.</strong> For banks running Claude in production, a 20% price cut and 30% speed gain directly offset the AI agent operating costs that McKinsey just flagged as a growing burden.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>OpenAI, Anthropic face new oversight as New York's AI safety law takes effect</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/10/openai-anthropic-face-new-oversight-as-new-yorks-ai-safety-law-takes-effect/\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">TechCrunch AI</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            New York is enforcing a sweeping AI safety law requiring major developers — including OpenAI and Anthropic — to register, disclose safety practices, and report critical incidents or face fines.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Vendor compliance is now a third-party risk factor.</strong> Banks using OpenAI or Anthropic models must monitor vendor adherence to New York's AI safety requirements as part of their AI governance and procurement frameworks.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>BioCatch launches AiRE to detect AI agents in digital banking</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOSnZ3UEU4dmhGUWpCSXhjdUhwOVhSRzFYVEVzWG9reHVIdWNPUlpRWjVvV0plV25mU3hmUk1JLTBkM3BQdThPNEdOZVhBWGVPV2FrenpzTnpfa3lqTW5UcTc3eEVJMXRZeE1GUm1OaGFaQzdrdHBFOFF2andmRjVDNERfWUlLV3hDSHZTOWhFTFRQNFd6WUdyYXU4M1owTWdXRTdKLW1aelREZExa?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">The Paypers</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            BioCatch launched AiRE, a behavioral biometrics tool built to detect when AI agents — rather than humans — are operating within digital banking sessions, targeting the growing fraud risk from AI-driven account takeovers.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>AI-detecting AI is now a product category.</strong> As agentic AI is weaponized for fraud, banks need detection capabilities beyond traditional behavioral analytics — AiRE is an early signal of what that security tooling looks like.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>Trust Stamp launches automated biometric-based authorization for transactions initiated by Agentic-AI</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">The Manila Times</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Trust Stamp launched a biometric authorization layer for AI agent-initiated financial transactions, requiring identity confirmation before an agent can move money on behalf of a user.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Solving the AI agent authorization gap.</strong> As regulators focus on agentic finance, biometric-gated authorization provides a defensible human-in-the-loop check — this architecture is likely to become a compliance baseline for banks.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>Cowbell launches standalone AI agent liability policy for SMEs</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOWmJ3cmp3OVlsbm9xRWFNaldhOENMTEV6Q3NKaUU2Y0FLWlY5Z0NKVzltSVVYYXhsSjJINWVLMmpYdW1uY21xM3RIbDFubnFGT0YyMXJfTVhfbGN0NElFUFh3U09YaTlIeVB6Y1Q2NU14TlN5TElKdUFKWC03WDcyWDhqcl9TbW1fLTN2dWY0Um1BaEszcGJyNjVySXRFWDBPMEZ5LUNOam01WGFNZndRMnV6Z3pxbnRqSmxoMDd5b01IRWNWMjBjY0p3?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Insurance Business</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Cowbell introduced a standalone insurance product covering AI agent-related liability for SMEs — the first of its kind, addressing legal and financial exposure when AI agents cause errors or take unauthorized actions.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Insurance market validates AI agent risk.</strong> When underwriters create standalone policies for a risk, it confirms that risk is quantifiable and real — financial institutions deploying agents should factor AI agent liability into their risk frameworks.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 6 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            6. <strong>Bank of Cyprus Debuts DANAI: The Island's First AI Banking Assistant for Instant Support</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNRm5Ya0tWM0M1OEx3OW1jUGYzTDVMejVVS2xwNmFnam5rRUszWnpib2JqaTRJTFhNdWFNS0VtRnFtWDR3VnVUR0tlRlVxeUw4ODBjdGFvbXVhWE1md1N2N1FRV1hnbFhNRHU3SHNfekUxamxTa0NZLTRsbkItQ3B5YURGTDFVQWQyOW9wVVhUZHJibkVjaWdv?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FF News</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Bank of Cyprus launched DANAI, the island's first AI-powered banking assistant, to handle instant customer support. The move extends AI-driven customer service beyond the largest global banks to regional institutions.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Regional banks are deploying too.</strong> DANAI signals AI customer service is no longer a tier-1 bank exclusive — mid-tier and regional institutions are now under competitive pressure to match the capability.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── AGENTIC STARTUPS SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n           